        "abstract": "IEEE Young Professionals in Circuits and Systems (YPCAS), under the IEEE Circuits and Systems Society (CASS) Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion Committee (DEI), successfully organized The IEEE Young Professionals in Circuits and Systems (YPCAS) Forum 2024 at the University of Macau, Macau SAR, China from November 27-28, 2024. This forum invited 7 young professors/ scholars from the field of circuits and systems to deliver different technical talks, introduce their career development, interact with young researchers and students to broaden their horizons, and provide guidance for their future career development. This forum was supported by the 2024 CASS Outreach Initiative, IEEE CASS DEI, The Science and Technology Development Fund, Macau SAR (FDCT), IEEE Macau Section, IEEE Macau Circuits and Systems Society (CAS) Chapter, and State Key Laboratory of Analog and Mixed-Signal VLSI & Institute of Microelectronics of University of Macau.",
